sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    participant CP as Portail Client
    participant CRC as ClientReservationController
    participant RS as ReservationService
    participant DB as DB

    C->>CP: Ouvrir reservation via token
    CP->>CRC: GET /reservation/{token}
    CRC->>DB: findByToken()
    DB-->>CRC: reservation detail
    CRC-->>CP: afficher dossier

    C->>CP: confirmer / modifier / annuler
    CP->>CRC: POST action
    CRC->>RS: appliquerReglesStatut()
    RS->>DB: update reservation
    DB-->>CRC: OK
    CRC-->>CP: action terminee
